title: PT_D3_Start
---
// Before this node: one "Unlock New Ingredient" popup with Whiskey, Dry Vermouth,
// Peppermint (day 3 in the table) and Rum (unlocked by the story on day 2).
<<eventlog_clear>>
Player: (PT) Day {$day}. flow_step = {flow_step()} (expect 3 / StoryBeforeOpen, after the unlock popup) #line:02ae91e 
Player: (PT) Whiskey = {ingredient_unlocked("Whiskey")}, DryVermouth = {ingredient_unlocked("DryVermouth")}, PepperMint = {ingredient_unlocked("PepperMint")}, Rum = {ingredient_unlocked("Rum")} (all True) #line:0cb7dd7 
Player: The supplier came by. Whiskey, vermouth and fresh mint on the shelf. #line:08092f4 
<<flow_check_events>>
Player: (PT) flow_check_events again: no popup (all already announced). #line:036687f 
Player: Last night of the week. Let's make it count. #line:0064311 
<<flow_open_bar>>
<<jump PT_D3_Eliana>>
===

title: PT_D3_Eliana
---
// ── Customer 1: branch on what the bar has ──
<<Eliana Enter 1>>
<<Eliana Neutral>>
Eliana: Do you have whiskey yet? The last owner never did. #line:09a0cc8 
<<order_customer "[CocktailSystem]" Eliana>>
<<if ingredient_unlocked("Whiskey")>>
    Player: Fresh in today. #line:08b4ce5 
    <<Eliana Happy>>
    Eliana: Then an [order]{Order_Cocktail_ByName_OutName("Old Fashioned")}[/order], please. #line:0379d2b 
<<else>>
    Player: Not yet, sorry. #line:071cf63 
    <<Eliana Disappointed>>
    Eliana: Oh. A [order]{Order_Cocktail_ByName_OutName("Gin Fizz")}[/order] then. #line:023f290 
<<endif>>
<<detour PT_MakeDrink>>

<<if $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Fail>>
    <<Eliana Disappointed>>
    Eliana: Hm. I'll stick to tea. #line:0429c02 
<<else>>
    <<Eliana Happy>>
    Eliana: Just like my grandfather made them. #line:0d81896 
<<endif>>
<<Reset_Variable SystemGame>>
<<Eliana Look L>>
Eliana: Someone's coming in. Good luck with him. #line:01e087d 
<<Eliana Exit>>
<<jump PT_D3_Arthur>>
===

title: PT_D3_Arthur
---
// ── Customer 2: random order, every Arthur expression ──
<<Arthur Enter 2>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController Char2Cam>>
<<Arthur Neutral>>
Arthur: So you're the one who reopened this place. #line:0e167db 
<<Arthur NeutralLeft>>
Arthur: The town council wasn't asked. #line:0ccbace 
<<Arthur Mockery>>
Arthur: Let's see if you're any good. Make me something. #line:0638b84 
<<order_customer "[CocktailSystem]" Arthur>>
Player: A [order]{Order_Cocktail_OutName(8)}[/order], then. #line:0bf9b5f 
<<Arthur HandIn>>
Arthur: Fine. #line:01696cf 
<<Cut_Camera CamController MainCam>>
<<detour PT_MakeDrink>>

<<if $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Perfect>>
    <<Arthur Neutral>>
    Arthur: ...Acceptable. Don't let it go to your head. #line:096caac 
<<elseif $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Acceptable>>
    <<Arthur Angry>>
    Arthur: Barely drinkable. #line:07c500d 
<<else>>
    <<Arthur Rage>>
    Arthur: [shake]Is this a joke?[/shake] #line:036fd03 
<<endif>>
<<Reset_Variable SystemGame>>
<<Arthur Look R>>
<<Arthur Exit>>
<<jump PT_D3_Isla>>
===

title: PT_D3_Isla
---
